      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "已打开详情页原文：Detail for Portfolios Formed on Earnings/Price Detail for Portfolios Formed on Net Share Issues Monthly Returns: July 1963 - July 2026 Annual Returns: 1964 - 2025 Portfolios: Net Share Issues NI < 0; NI = 0; quintiles; deciles. Construction: The portfolios are formed on Net Share Issues (NI) at the end of each June using NYSE breakpoints. NI for June of year t is the change in the natural log of split-adjusted shares outstanding from the fiscal yearend in t-2 to the fiscal yearend in t-1. Stocks: All NYSE, AMEX, and NASDAQ stocks for which we have market equity data for June of t and non-missing split-adjusted shares outstanding data for t-2 and t-1."
